        "type": "markdown",
        "source": {
          "kind": "literal",
          "markdown": "**確認:** 着手前に優先度と見積もりを見直します。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "task-status",
        "type": "field-list",
        "title": "現在の設定",
        "columns": 2,
        "fields": ["title", "priority", "estimatedMinutes", "ready"]
      },
      {
        "id": "task-notes",
        "type": "markdown",
        "title": "記録",
        "source": {
          "kind": "field",
          "field": "notes"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "contacts": {
    "schemaVersion": "configurable-detail-layout.v1",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "contact-guidance",
        "type": "markdown",
        "source": {
          "kind": "literal",
          "markdown": "> 送る前に、相手・連絡手段・伝える内容を確認します。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "contact-summary",
        "type": "field-list",
        "title": "連絡設定",
        "fields": ["subject", "channel", "followUp"]
